# =============================================================================
# Shared / tracked environment (committed on purpose)
# =============================================================================
# Lovable previews and published builds inline VITE_* from this file at build
# time. Gitignoring `.env` breaks staging. See:
#   https://docs.lovable.dev/features/secrets
#
# Contents here are PUBLIC by design (URL + anon/publishable key + project id).
# They ship to every browser; RLS protects data — not key secrecy.
#
# DO NOT put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (or any true secret) in this file.
# Put secrets and personal overrides in `.env.local` (gitignored; wins over
# this file for the same key). Template: `.env.example`.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client (Vite build-time — embedded in the browser bundle)
